---
 Keys  /keys                                                         Esc returns
  ↑                recall_prompt        Recall an earlier prompt from the
                                        project of the session on screen
  ←                focus_rail           Move focus from an empty input box into
                                        the rail
  Ctrl+R           search_prompts       Search those prompts
  ⌥← ⌥→, Ctrl+←    move_word            Move by word
  Ctrl+→, ⌥B ⌥F
  ⌥Backspace,      delete_word          Delete a word
  Ctrl+Backspace,
  Ctrl+W
  Ctrl+U           delete_to_line_start Delete to the start of the line
  Ctrl+A Ctrl+E,   line_start_end       Start or end of the line
  ⌘← ⌘→
  Ctrl+G           open_in_editor       Open the draft, or a pasted token, in
                                        $VISUAL or $EDITOR
  Ctrl+V           paste_image          Paste an image
  Ctrl+O           toggle_ledgers       Open or close the ledgers
  Shift+Tab        navigate             Move focus from the input box into the
                                        conversation
  ↓ ↑, j k         focus_next_prev      Move focus to the next or previous item
› Shift+↓ Shift+↑  focus_project        Move to the first row of the next or
                                        previous project in the session list
↑↓ move · Enter rebind · r reset · Delete unbind · Esc close
